#~ "an und mach es dir zu eigen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Metadata arrives automatically — cover "
#~ "art, genres, ratings, compatibility info, "
#~ "game modes — so you spend time "
#~ "browsing, not cataloguing. When you find"
#~ " something to play, {name} hands it"
#~ " off to the right launcher."
